# Great Fierce Bee {2}{B} (paid exactly with Mox Jet's {B} and Mana Crypt's {C}{C}): "Whenever one or more other creatures die, scry
# 1." Bot2's first Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Memnite while the Bee lives: Bot1 scries once and puts the Lightning Bolt on top of
# its library on the bottom, so the draw on turn 3 is a Plains. Bot2's second Bolt kills the Bee with no other creature dying:
# no scry happens (a second question would be asked before Bot1's next priority).

